    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you trust your memory\u2026 in the dark?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a creaky, pitch-black mansion. You're given a task: maybe to turn on a lamp, open a drawer, or unlock a door. Simple, right? But next time, you'll have to do that task <i>again</i>, plus a new one. Then another. Then another\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>10 consecutive stages</strong> without a single mistake to escape. But beware: interact with the wrong object, forget a task, or mess with something extra\u2026 and you're sent <i>all the way back</i> to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game of Memory &amp; Focus</strong> <br>Each stage builds on the last. Success means remembering all your previous tasks and <i>only</i> interacting with what\u2019s needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Mode</strong>: 5 stages with helpful feedback when you mess up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong>: 10 stages. No hints. No mercy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: How far can your memory take you?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trials</strong>: Beat the clock \u2014 fast memory, faster reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunter Mode</strong> <i>(Coming Soon)</i>: Search and locate a hidden object before time runs out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creepy Atmosphere</strong> <br>Random whispers echo through empty rooms. Nothing\u2019s chasing you... but it <i>feels</i> like something is.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you trust your memory\u2026 in the dark?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a creaky, pitch-black mansion. You're given a task: maybe to turn on a lamp, open a drawer, or unlock a door. Simple, right? But next time, you'll have to do that task <i>again</i>, plus a new one. Then another. Then another\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>10 consecutive stages</strong> without a single mistake to escape. But beware: interact with the wrong object, forget a task, or mess with something extra\u2026 and you're sent <i>all the way back</i> to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game of Memory &amp; Focus</strong> <br>Each stage builds on the last. Success means remembering all your previous tasks and <i>only</i> interacting with what\u2019s needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Mode</strong>: 5 stages with helpful feedback when you mess up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong>: 10 stages. No hints. No mercy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: How far can your memory take you?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trials</strong>: Beat the clock \u2014 fast memory, faster reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunter Mode</strong> <i>(Coming Soon)</i>: Search and locate a hidden object before time runs out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creepy Atmosphere</strong> <br>Random whispers echo through empty rooms. Nothing\u2019s chasing you... but it <i>feels</i> like something is.</p>",
    "short_description": "Escape a haunted mansion by completing memory-based tasks across multiple stages. Every mistake resets your progress. Can you stay calm, focused, and survive the darkness?",
